          "expires": null,
          "description": "\u00a72.1 in-app rider<->driver chat (/api/v1/chat REST + chat.ride.{rideId} WS topic). Kill switch: FEATURE_CHAT=false (env) unmounts the routes at next boot; persisted messages remain in Postgres. Default false in production per Global Rule 6.",
          "category": "ride_parity",
